#: ../../index.md:3
msgid ""
"A fast, multi-engine prose linter for VS Code and Neovim with a Rust core."
msgstr ""

#: ../../index.md:5
msgid ""
"Language Check catches grammar, spelling, and style issues in Markdown, "
"HTML, LaTeX, Typst, reStructuredText, Org mode, BibTeX, Forester, and R "
"Sweave files using [Harper](https://github.com/elijah-potter/harper), "
"optional [LanguageTool](https://languagetool.org/), optional [Vale](https://"
"vale.sh/), and optional [Proselint](https://github.com/amperser/proselint) "
"integration."
msgstr ""

